  "keys": "space-separated keydowns: `+`-joined modifiers, a leading `!` aims the key at an editable, an uppercase letter is shifted, a bare `Shift` is a modifier-only keydown; `code` is the US one. An object is a raw keydown.",
  "steps": "pass · cancelled (a pass that dropped an open scope) · opened · closed · held · run <command>: <sequence>",
  "cases": [
    { "why": "the leader opens its scope, a leaf runs", "keys": ["Alt+s", "u"], "steps": ["opened", "run undo: Alt+S U"] },
    { "why": "bare keys are not ours", "keys": ["u", "U", "?", "Backspace", "Escape"], "steps": ["pass", "pass", "pass", "pass", "pass"] },
